{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\eng\\151.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "ComprehensionQuestions", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[24, 178], [434, 182], [434, 218], [24, 214]]}, {"text": "Answerthefollowingquestions.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[21, 215], [454, 219], [454, 256], [21, 252]]}, {"text": "What is meant by a futurologist?", "conf": 0.866, "box": [[64, 262], [483, 270], [482, 300], [63, 291]]}, {"text": "a.", "conf": 0.664, "box": [[27, 274], [49, 274], [49, 295], [27, 295]]}, {"text": "b.", "conf": 0.507, "box": [[28, 314], [52, 314], [52, 335], [28, 335]]}, {"text": " Do you think space tourism is possible? Support your answer with reasons from the", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[63, 305], [1089, 320], [1089, 355], [62, 340]]}, {"text": "passage.", "conf": 0.863, "box": [[70, 356], [184, 353], [185, 381], [71, 383]]}, {"text": "C.", "conf": 0.61, "box": [[28, 400], [49, 400], [49, 424], [28, 424]]}, {"text": "Who predicted that space travels will be more frequent?", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[72, 393], [766, 403], [766, 433], [71, 423]]}, {"text": "d.", "conf": 0.646, "box": [[29, 439], [55, 439], [55, 465], [29, 465]]}, {"text": "At what height will the passengers be transported above the earth?", "conf": 0.944, "box": [[70, 437], [901, 446], [901, 479], [69, 470]]}, {"text": "e.", "conf": 0.658, "box": [[31, 484], [53, 484], [53, 507], [31, 507]]}, {"text": "The article talks about some of the disadvantages of space tourism. Can you think", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[72, 479], [1069, 490], [1069, 523], [71, 512]]}, {"text": "of more?", "conf": 0.828, "box": [[77, 519], [197, 522], [196, 553], [76, 550]]}, {"text": "Writing", "conf": 0.81, "box": [[118, 569], [272, 580], [269, 618], [115, 606]]}, {"text": "Stories about space travel are fun and, at the same time, very challenging to write. This is", "conf": 0.946, "box": [[30, 645], [1105, 655], [1105, 688], [30, 678]]}, {"text": "because since no one has ever explored every nook and cranny of Earth's outer space.", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[30, 689], [1072, 702], [1072, 735], [30, 722]]}, {"text": "Everything is up to your imagination-from how the \"galaxy far, far away\" and its", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[31, 734], [1012, 745], [1011, 778], [31, 766]]}, {"text": "inhabitants would look to the technology they might use to reach the final frontier.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[30, 775], [1035, 787], [1035, 822], [30, 811]]}, {"text": "Your turn to write:", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[42, 834], [303, 838], [303, 865], [42, 861]]}, {"text": "Write a paragraph based on the following prompt:", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[42, 868], [669, 878], [668, 910], [42, 900]]}, {"text": "Imagine that you get a chance to travel in the space. What will you do? What will you", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[45, 907], [1068, 920], [1068, 949], [45, 936]]}, {"text": "eat? Remember that it's zero gravity so you will not be able to feel your weight. How", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[46, 940], [1061, 956], [1061, 988], [46, 971]]}, {"text": "will you move?", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[51, 980], [252, 980], [252, 1006], [51, 1006]]}, {"text": "ing", "conf": 0.664, "box": [[461, 1150], [566, 1056], [603, 1099], [499, 1192]]}, {"text": "144", "conf": 0.627, "box": [[578, 1541], [630, 1541], [630, 1571], [578, 1571]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.827, "box": [[689, 1546], [882, 1551], [881, 1577], [688, 1572]]}, {"text": "awaz e inqilab.com", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[480, 1709], [760, 1709], [760, 1739], [480, 1739]]}]}